      "short": "$15\\pi\\text{ m}^2\\approx47.12\\text{ m}^2$",
      "worked": "The ramp is the open curved riding surface. Its radius is 3 m, half the 6 m diameter.\n$$\\begin{aligned}A&=\\tfrac12(2\\pi(3))(5)=15\\pi\\text{ m}^2\\\\A&\\approx47.12\\text{ m}^2.\\end{aligned}$$",
